+      # The full suites exercise TargetPlatform.ohos and real Huawei view types.
+      # Keep the core source intact and use the same pinned SDK as the HAP job.
+      - name: Set up OHOS Flutter and shared core
+        uses: ./qflistudio/.github/actions/app-setup
